---
sequenceDiagram
  actor Browser as Person / browser
  box Controller process
    participant Auth as Authentication
    participant Owners as Account + IAM + State
  end
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Provider as Identity provider
  Note over Browser,Provider: 1 · Start proposed browser journey
  Browser->>Auth: Trusted-origin start, selected provider
  Auth->>Owners: Reserve bound one-use attempt
  Owners->>DB: Persist attempt with finite expiry
  DB-->>Owners: Acknowledge persistence
  Owners-->>Auth: Bound attempt
  Auth-->>Browser: Authorization URL
  Browser->>Provider: Sign in and authorize
  Provider-->>Browser: Exact callback with code and state
  Note over Browser,DB: 2 · Consume attempt before remote work
  Browser->>Auth: Bound callback
  Auth->>Owners: Match and consume attempt
  Owners->>DB: Atomic consumption
  DB-->>Owners: Consumption acknowledged
  Owners-->>Auth: Consumed attempt
  Note over Auth,Provider: 3 · Remote verification outside State locks
  Auth->>Provider: Bounded exchange and identity verification
  Provider-->>Auth: Token response / authenticated identity
  Auth->>Auth: Validate then discard provider tokens
  Note over Auth,DB: 4 · Short guarded session transaction
  Auth->>Owners: Verified provider instance and subject
  Owners->>DB: Guard current method and active account
  DB-->>Owners: Current association and version
  alt Known current account
    Owners->>DB: Insert fresh session and required login facts
    DB-->>Owners: COMMIT acknowledgment or unknown
    alt Commit acknowledged
      Owners-->>Auth: Persisted session accepted
      Auth-->>Browser: Ordinary stored-session cookie
    else Commit uncertain
      Owners-->>Auth: Unknown outcome
      Auth-->>Browser: No credential, no blind replay
    end
  else Unknown verified identity
    Owners-->>Auth: No matching active account
    Auth-->>Browser: Actionable no-access result, no session
  end
  Note over Browser,DB: 5 · Only acknowledged session enters authorized Console
  Browser->>Auth: Configuration / Agent lifecycle request
  Auth->>Owners: Admit current session, authorize exact operation
  Owners->>DB: Allowed resource operation and required facts
  DB-->>Owners: Acknowledged result
  Owners-->>Auth: Authorized result
  Auth-->>Browser: Console result within granted scope
